  "tituloTerminos1": "1. Acceptance of Terms",
  "textoTerminos1": "By downloading, registering or using the Activelo application, you agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree with any of them, you must refrain from using the platform.",
  "tituloTerminos2": "2. Service Description",
  "textoTerminos2": "Activelo is a platform designed for the configuration, control and monitoring of physical and agility training routines through interaction with wireless interactive devices.",
  "tituloTerminos3": "3. User Accounts",
  "textoTerminos3": "To access synchronization of your history and performance statistics, you must register an account with a valid email. You are solely responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your credentials.",
