  "tituloPrivacidad1": "1. Information Collected",
  "textoPrivacidad1": "We only collect essential data to provide the service:\n• Identification data: Registration email.\n• Training metrics: Reaction times, number of touches, modes used and dates of each session.",
  "tituloPrivacidad2": "2. Required Permissions",
  "textoPrivacidad2": "To link and transmit the routines to the training devices, the application will request wireless connection (Bluetooth) and location permissions in cases required by the operating system.",
  "tituloPrivacidad3": "3. Use of Information",
  "textoPrivacidad3": "The stored data is used exclusively to allow access to your account, calculate your personal performance statistics and show you your progress history.",
  "tituloPrivacidad4": "4. Data Protection",
  "textoPrivacidad4": "We implement security measures to protect your information stored in the cloud. We do not sell or share your personal data with third parties for commercial or advertising purposes.",
